WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.279
the emergence of organic life

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:07.350
from what preceded it

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.780
is as dramatic a miracle as anyone could imagine.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.630
The emergence of language from mute

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.880
bestiality, which is only 100,000 years in the past,

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.390
is as dramatic a miracle as anyone could imagine.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:28.000
The emergence of a planet instantaneously

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.779
unified by electricity and media is

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:35.790
- and this is only 50, 60 years in our past, it's still going on -

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.180
is as dramatic a miracle as anyone could imagine.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.270
It's absolutely irrational

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:47.520
to not be filled with the fire of consuming hope.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.969
You just have to overcome

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:54.030
the leveling that we inherit

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.200
from these empty, existential scientific ideas.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.739
And when we do that

00:00:59.739 --> 00:01:04.140
and lift our eyes to the real, living

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.740
spiritually

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.860
empowered reality that exists in nature,

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.240
in society, in our lover

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.400
in ourselves,

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:21.350
then you see that the peacock's tail, the cauda pavonis,

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:26.600
is a transcendental object at the end of time.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.720
An enormous.. uhh..

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:35.070
unspeakable something..  that beckons

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:40.660
across the historical landscape, that casts an enormous shadow

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:45.470
that reaches clear back to the earliest moments of the universe.

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:48.970
That we have always been in the grip

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:52.210
of that iridescent, strange attractor.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.400
It has propelled our poetry, our art.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.990
Our best moments have always been

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:05.110
when the tiny spark of that alchemical completion

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:08.399
burned for a moment in our mind,

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:11.910
in our life, in our perception.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.930
And we occupy a special position

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:18.480
in regard to this. Millions..

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.510
thousands of generations

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:25.550
of human beings, have come and gone and could only

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:29.000
glimpse this in the ecstasy

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.000
of eroticism and psychedelic empowerment

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.700
and ritual magic.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.200
But we are...

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.600
.. the last people.

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.150
Beyond us lies the mystery,

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:50.300
if we have but the courage to move forward into that abyss.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.250
To believe that nature will reward

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.260
the dreamer. It cannot wander

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:01.230
much longer. All of the preconditions

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.870
have been met and the peacock's tail

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.070
grows daily, whiter, and more

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:11.370
radiant and more brilliant, as we

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.430
sense now, breaking into our dreams,

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:17.720
breaking into our waking lives, the presence

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:21.440
of this attractor.  It has always given people meaning

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:24.560
but we are the privileged inheritors

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.050
of that meaning. And we have then,

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.630
the privilege of putting it all together

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.000
in one piece and standing ready at the end of

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.000
history, to go into

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.549
the mystery and be completed.

